  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1163/10/bannertrim-png.png\" alt=\"精靈翅膀鞘翅橫幅\" width=\"2046\" height=\"1098\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>讓您的鞘翅飛行增添一抹魔法氣息，這款精靈主題的粉彩鞘翅絕對是首選！<br>設計靈感來自典型的小仙子翅膀，旨在呈現出如蜻蜓般半透明的質感，並帶有更具魔法色彩的蛋白石幻彩發光效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/VznX8ddb/images/7a2dbd27a1c586eb87b2391d1186e12a9680ef93.png\" alt=\"精靈翅膀鞘翅展示圖\"></p>\n<p>也歡迎前往查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/fairy-wings-elytra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基岩版精靈翅膀鞘翅</a>！<br>正在尋找更多精靈主題的資源包嗎？請查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252ftRl3fJJM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Garden Gals 妖精風格精選集</a>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fgarden-gals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gardengals/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"贊助我們\"></a></p>",
